{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">車婉婉日前在社交網上分享了接兒子放學的溫馨合照，並大方曬出愛兒的學生手冊內頁相片。車婉婉特意抽空親自接「開心仔」BBQ放學，並感嘆歲月飛逝，指兒子眨眼間已經升上四年級，成為了一名「哥哥仔」。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"23a7dd72-7220-4696-9128-055411ed3c44.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026oO2UNnwZlg1788749603.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"23a7dd72-7220-4696-9128-055411ed3c44.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">車婉婉指，升上小四的 BBQ 迎來了「第一大轉變」，就是學生手冊上的字體突然變得非常整齊工整！看到兒子的進步，車婉婉亦不忘給予鼓勵，留言笑言這是一個好的開始，更向兒子溫馨打氣：「MaMa 努力工作，BBQ先生都要努力加油呀，Q氏一齊進步！」</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"805c0fff-aa19-4507-b499-4a4e21d1728e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026x25wxu01G41788749603.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"805c0fff-aa19-4507-b499-4a4e21d1728e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-07T04:20:02.629811+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}